{
    "title": "Shipt: Deliver & Earn Money",
    "description": "Shipt is a delivery app that allows you to earn money as a personal shopper for groceries, a food delivery driver, or a package delivery driver*, with same-day pay! \r\nNeed a new side hustle? Want to build a full time or part time role as a delivery driver? Shipt is hiring for friendly & reliable personal shoppers and package delivery drivers to take on delivery jobs near you, helping Shipt members shop for the things they need and deliver groceries to them! Earn money driving, shopping & making deliveries. Set your schedule with flexible hours to shop, and deliver groceries from local stores to our valued members as a personal shopper or grocery delivery driver. Shipt provides flexibility to choose your schedule. \r\nEARN MONEY & GET PAID FAST \r\nShipt offers you flexible work! Sign up as a personal shopper or package delivery driver to start making money when it is convenient for you! \r\nGet paid fast as a personal shopper or package delivery driver with same day pay. Get a job that pays you daily with in-app tips you earned!  \r\nShipt ensures our personal shoppers and delivery drivers always receive 100% of the tips they earned from their deliveries!  \r\n  \r\nCREATE A SCHEDULE CONVENIENT FOR YOU  \r\nOur personal shoppers' and package delivery drivers' schedules are based on when they want to earn money delivering groceries and more.   \r\nA Flexible Delivery App: Set your perfect job and working schedule as a personal shopper and delivery driver with Shipt, whether you're looking for a side hustle, full or part time job. Deliver groceries when it is convenient for you!   \r\n  \r\nSIGN UP, SHOP & DELIVER GROCERIES OR FOOD & EARN MONEY   \r\nJoin our community of personal shoppers and package delivery drivers to find instant work and gig opportunities that allow you to cashout instantly with same day pay from driving, shopping & making deliveries. Enjoy the flexibility to work on your own terms while connecting with customers in your area. \r\n  \r\nJOIN OUR COMMUNITY OF PERSONAL SHOPPERS, PACKAGE DELIVERY DRIVERS & CUSTOMERS  \r\nYou will join a community of shoppers & grocery delivery drivers.   \r\nShare inside tips & stories with other personal shoppers and drivers.   \r\nOur shopping jobs provide a valuable service to the people in their community who need it the most. We\u2019re always on the lookout for onboarding personal shoppers and package delivery drivers who help us deliver happiness.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Shipt is a delivery app that allows you to earn money as a personal shopper for groceries, a food delivery driver, or a package delivery driver*, with same-day pay! <br>Need a new side hustle? Want to build a full time or part time role as a delivery driver? Shipt is hiring for friendly &amp; reliable personal shoppers and package delivery drivers to take on delivery jobs near you, helping Shipt members shop for the things they need and deliver groceries to them! Earn money driving, shopping &amp; making deliveries. Set your schedule with flexible hours to shop, and deliver groceries from local stores to our valued members as a personal shopper or grocery delivery driver. Shipt provides flexibility to choose your schedule. <br>EARN MONEY &amp; GET PAID FAST <br>Shipt offers you flexible work! Sign up as a personal shopper or package delivery driver to start making money when it is convenient for you! <br>Get paid fast as a personal shopper or package delivery driver with same day pay. Get a job that pays you daily with in-app tips you earned!  <br>Shipt ensures our personal shoppers and delivery drivers always receive 100% of the tips they earned from their deliveries!  <br>  <br>CREATE A SCHEDULE CONVENIENT FOR YOU  <br>Our personal shoppers&#39; and package delivery drivers&#39; schedules are based on when they want to earn money delivering groceries and more.   <br>A Flexible Delivery App: Set your perfect job and working schedule as a personal shopper and delivery driver with Shipt, whether you&#39;re looking for a side hustle, full or part time job. Deliver groceries when it is convenient for you!   <br>  <br>SIGN UP, SHOP &amp; DELIVER GROCERIES OR FOOD &amp; EARN MONEY   <br>Join our community of personal shoppers and package delivery drivers to find instant work and gig opportunities that allow you to cashout instantly with same day pay from driving, shopping &amp; making deliveries. Enjoy the flexibility to work on your own terms while connecting with customers in your area. <br>  <br>JOIN OUR COMMUNITY OF PERSONAL SHOPPERS, PACKAGE DELIVERY DRIVERS &amp; CUSTOMERS  <br>You will join a community of shoppers &amp; grocery delivery drivers.   <br>Share inside tips &amp; stories with other personal shoppers and drivers.   <br>Our shopping jobs provide a valuable service to the people in their community who need it the most. We\u2019re always on the lookout for onboarding personal shoppers and package delivery drivers who help us deliver happiness.",
